00:46:14.730 --> 00:46:21.650
I investigate, because with prop food, when you start out, it's usually really fresh and warm, and they've made it ready for you to eat.

1035
00:46:21.790 --> 00:46:28.810
But as each take goes, it gets colder and colder and a little bit more wilty, depending what you're eating.

1036
00:46:29.050 --> 00:46:32.650
And I just found early on the smaller bites are better.

1037
00:46:33.050 --> 00:46:33.210
True.

