00:50:09.410 --> 00:50:12.750
I did not know that you knew the answer to that question when I asked it.

1127
00:50:13.170 --> 00:50:14.550
Yeah, it's in the shooting draft.

1128
00:50:15.290 --> 00:50:16.870
Oh, the shooting draft.

1129
00:50:17.010 --> 00:50:18.370
It unlocks so many mysteries.

